body.translated_text:
In this world, there are persons
who are my devotees, following you;
you are indeed, among all my devotees,

'<s>Rukmiṇī</s> in <s>Dvāravatī</s>; <s>Rādhā</s> in the forest of <s>Vṛndāvana</s>;
<s>Sītā</s> in <s>Citrakūṭa</s>; the dweller of <s>Vindhya</s> in the <s>Vindhya</s>;
<s>Devakī</s> in <s>Mathurā</s>; the supreme goddess in the netherworld.' — and so on. (end page 28)
